PMAG‐J  and  PMAGB‐J  TX colour unaccelerated 2‐D framebuffer The
driver provides support for the  PMAG‐J  and  PMAGB‐J  TX  colour
framebuffer  for the TURBOchannel bus.  The PMAG‐J is an 8 bpp or
24 bpp colour framebuffer capable of running at a  resolution  of
1280‐by‐1024  at 66 Hz.  The PMAGB‐J is an 8 bpp or 24 bpp colour
framebuffer capable of running at a resolution of 1280‐by‐1024 at
72 Hz.
